      "type": "instruction",
      "text": "Principle 6. My school teacher"
    },
    {
      "type": "sentences",
      "items": [
        {
          "n": "62",
          "text": "My school offers many activities and exciting classes."
        },
        {
          "n": "63",
          "text": "As well it is known for great teachers."
        },
        {
          "n": "64",
          "text": "My brother and sister go to the same school."
        },
        {
          "n": "65",
          "text": "There are many clubs that students can join."
        },
        {
          "n": "66",
          "text": "I am a member of the English club."
        },
        {
          "n": "67",
          "text": "My teacher's name is Kim Sumi and she is 27 years old."
        },
        {
          "n": "68",
          "text": "She always makes learning fun."
        },
        {
          "n": "69",
          "text": "She is very friendly and I like her a lot."
        },
        {
          "n": "70",
          "text": "She always wears green dresses."
        },
        {
          "n": "71",
          "text": "I think she likes the color green."
        },
        {
          "n": "72",
          "text": "My teacher has a habit of touching her hair when she teaches."
        },
        {
          "n": "73",
          "text": "My teacher always tells us to set goals in order to reach our dreams."
        },
        {
          "n": "74",
          "text": "She is very kind to every student and helps us develop our talents."
        }
      ]
    },
